  "about": "Official product pictures for the Devices room, by model and variant. Exo ships only these links: it fetches each picture from the maker's own image server (or OpenMouse's render server for mice) when a device first shows, fits it to one frame and keeps it on this PC (Services/DeviceImages.cs). Every picture is the maker's straight-on hero shot (top-down for mice and keyboards, the face for controllers, front for headphones) on white, a flat studio color or transparency. The first entry of a model is its default; variant is a controller's color or a keyboard's layout; cut says what else comes away with a photo's background (shadow: the studio's soft shadow; holes: background seen through a closed cable loop).",
